OL,3,GNEWSASecurity alert over after device
OL,4,Aleft on windowsill declared
OL,5,A'non-viable'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA security alert in Dervock has ended
OL,8,Fafter a suspicious object left on a
OL,9,Fwindowsill was deemed non-viable and a
OL,10,Fcontrolled explosion was carried out.
OL,12,FThe device, found in Greystone
OL,13,FCrescent, was reported to police at
OL,14,Fabout 17:00 GMT on Friday.
OL,16,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,17,F(PSNI) Inspector Hamilton said officers
OL,18,Fnoted that it was a "potential
OL,19,Fexplosive device".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
